<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LivetvApp - About Us</title>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/clappr@latest/dist/clappr.min.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  /* Material 3 Color Palette Simulation (Updated for Deep Blue Theme) */
  :root {
    --primary: #0D47A1;    /* Deep Blue - Primary Action */
    --accent: #00BCD4;     /* Bright Cyan - Secondary Accent */
    --bg-dark: #0A1929;    /* Very Dark Navy - Main Background */
    --bg-card: #1A2C40;    /* Dark Blue Surface - Card Background */
    --text: #E0F7FA;       /* Light Text */
    --outline: #546E7A;    /* Muted Blue-Grey - Outline/Subtext */
    --shadow-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  body { 
    margin: 0; 
    font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; 
    background: var(--bg-dark); 
    color: var(--text); 
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* --- Top App Bar (Navbar) --- */
  nav {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 4%; 
    background: var(--bg-card); 
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; /* Header z-index: 50 */
    box-shadow: 0 2px 4px var(--shadow-color); 
    min-height: 64px; 
  }
  .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none;}
  .logo span { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 500;} 
  
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-left: 50px; 
    flex-grow: 1; 
  }
  .nav-link {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-link:hover {
    /* Updated Primary Color RGBA */
    background: rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.2); 
  }

  .search-wrapper { position: relative; }
  .search-wrapper input {
    background: #000000; 
    border: none; 
    padding: 10px 40px 10px 15px;
    border-radius: 24px; 
    color: var(--text); 
    width: 250px; 
    transition: 0.3s;
    font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--outline); 
  }
  
  .search-wrapper input:focus { 
    border-color: transparent; 
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--primary); 
  }

  .search-icon { position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 10px; color: var(--outline); }

  /* --- Ads --- */
  .ad-slot {
    width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; margin: 16px auto; min-height: 80px;
    background: var(--bg-dark); 
    border: 1px dashed var(--outline); 
    display: flex; 
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--outline); 
    font-size: 14px;
    border-radius: 12px; 
  }

  /* --- Content Area --- */
  .container { padding: 16px 4%; max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; }
  
  .breadcrumb { 
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; 
    margin-bottom: 20px; 
  }
  .section-title { 
    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; 
    padding-left: 0; 
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  
  /* --- About Page Specific Styles --- */
  .about-content {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--shadow-color);
  }
  .about-content h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-top: 25px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline); /* Used Outline for subtle border */
      padding-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .about-content p {
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /* Existing Styles for consistency (Hidden Player/Grid are unused here but included for full style block) */
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .grid-full-span { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .card { background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; border: none; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px var(--shadow-color); }
  .back-btn { display: none; }

  /* Responsive Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .search-wrapper input { width: 120px; }
    .nav-links { display: none; } 
    .section-title { font-size: 24px; }
    .about-content { padding: 20px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="/" class="logo">Livetv<span>App</span></a>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="/" class="nav-link">Home</a>
    <a href="/streams" class="nav-link">Channels</a>
    <a href="/about" class="nav-link" style="background: rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.2);">About</a> </div>
  <div class="search-wrapper">
    <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Find channels...">
    <i class="fas fa-search search-icon"></i>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="ad-slot" id="adContainer1">
  Advertisement Slot
</div>

<div class="container">
  
  <h2 class="section-title">About LivetvApp</h2>

  <div class="about-content">
    <p>LivetvApp is dedicated to providing the fastest and most reliable live TV streaming experience available online. Our mission is to break down geographical barriers and deliver global content directly to your screen with unparalleled quality.</p>

    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
    <p>আমাদের লক্ষ্য হল এমন একটি প্ল্যাটফর্ম তৈরি করা যেখানে ব্যবহারকারীরা কোনো বাধা বা সাবস্ক্রিপশন ছাড়াই বিশ্বের যেকোনো প্রান্তের লাইভ চ্যানেলগুলো উপভোগ করতে পারবে। আমরা একটি সহজ, দ্রুত এবং বিজ্ঞাপন-বান্ধব পরিবেশ তৈরি করতে প্রতিশ্রুতিবদ্ধ।</p>

    <h3>Technology & Reliability</h3>
    <p>আমরা Clappr প্লেয়ার এবং আধুনিক HLS প্রযুক্তি ব্যবহার করি যাতে ভিডিও স্ট্রিমিং মসৃণ এবং বাফার-মুক্ত থাকে। আমাদের CDN (Content Delivery Network) সিস্টেম নিশ্চিত করে যে আপনি যেখানেই থাকুন না কেন, আপনার স্ট্রিম দ্রুত লোড হবে।</p>
    
    <h3>Contact & Support</h3>
    <p>If you have any questions, feedback, or need technical support, please contact us at: <a href="https://t.me/livetvappbd" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none;">support@livetvappbd.com</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="ad-slot" id="adContainer2" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 30px;">
    Another Advertisement Slot
  </div>

</div>

<script>
window.addEventListener('load', function(){
  // --- AD RELOAD LOGIC (Simplified for non-player pages) ---
  function injectAdScript(containerId) {
    const container = document.getElementById(containerId);
    if (!container) return;
    
    container.innerHTML = '';
    
    const script1 = document.createElement('script');
    script1.type = 'text/javascript';
    script1.innerHTML = `
        var atOptions = {
            'key' : 'fa36be29858fbb2600610990328422a3',
            'format' : 'iframe',
            'height' : 60,
            'width' : 468,
            'params' : {}
        };
    `;
    container.appendChild(script1);
    
    const script2 = document.createElement('script');
    script2.type = 'text/javascript';
    script2.src = '//www.highperformanceformat.com/fa36be29858fbb2600610990328422a3/invoke.js';
    container.appendChild(script2);
  }

  function reloadAds() {
      injectAdScript('adContainer1');
      injectAdScript('adContainer2');
      console.log('Ad sections pre-loaded/reloaded successfully in the background.');
  }

  reloadAds(); 
  setInterval(reloadAds, 60000); 

  // Disable search bar functionality for the about page
  document.getElementById('searchInput').disabled = true;

});
</script>
</body>
</html>
